			"notes": "First release for Minecraft 26.3.\n\n- Paintings whose texture has transparent or semi-transparent pixels are drawn with real transparency.\n- Fully opaque paintings are untouched and render exactly like vanilla.\n- Painting sides are only drawn where the image border is at least 50% opaque.\n- Client-side only, no dependencies. Tested with Sodium, Iris and Complementary Reimagined."
